OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells, although a few
OL,7,Flight showers are possible, mainly
OL,8,Fduring the morning. Winds will be
OL,9,Fgentle to moderate.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny light showers will clear
OL,12,Faway to leave it dry and partly
OL,13,Fcloudy. Best of clear spells will be
OL,14,Facross Orkney later in the night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA dry day with patchy cloud
OL,17,Facross Shetland during the morning,
OL,18,Fbut becoming widely sunny through the
OL,19,Fafternoon. Southwesterly winds will
OL,20,Fgradually freshen.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
